# Variables
@server_url = http://localhost:8080
@access_token = 
### Update Chosen Column
PUT {{server_url}}/api/chosenColumn HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"chosenColumn": 3
}


### Get User Info
GET {{server_url}}/api/userInfo HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{access_token}}